---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Macro Easy - Support"
  description="Need help with Macro Easy?"
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/macro-easy/support"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-8">Support</h1>

        <div class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-12">
          <p class="text-lg mb-4">Need help with Macro Easy?</p>
          <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com?subject=Macro%20Easy%20Support" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a> and we will help you with setup, logging, and troubleshooting.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">How do I update macro targets?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Open the home dashboard and choose the target section. Protein, carbohydrate, and fat targets are editable at any time.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Can I log favorites quickly?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Yes. Favorite meals and recent entries can be reused from the quick log flow to reduce repeated typing.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Does it sync to Health?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Macro Easy can optionally save totals into Apple Health. This is optional and respects your permissions.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Will my nutrition data leave my phone?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">No. Logs and targets are stored locally, and no ad/analytics network traffic is used.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
